/*.png
# The rule above covers a screenshot taken where the emulator is usually run. This
# one covers the other case: a screenshot written while the working directory
# happened to be a package, which is how test runs once left files in
# internal/frontend. It is deliberately scoped to the code tree: ./screenshots/ is
# a real directory with committed files in it, and nothing there should be hidden.
internal/**/screenshot-*.png
/zxgo-test
testdata/Games/
/disktest
/tapetest
/mediatest
/log.txt
/*.prof
/*.out
